5分足を取得して分析します）。</div><div class=\"spwrap\"><div class=\"nhead\">値動きと長期支持帯<span class=\"spbtns\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '1')\">1年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn on\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '3')\">3年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, '10')\">10年</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"spbtn\" onclick=\"spSwap(this, 'all')\">全期間(26年)</button></span></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"1\" style=\"display:none\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,27.0 9.1,28.5 14.2,35.0 19.3,45.0 24.5,38.7 29.6,49.4 34.7,47.3 39.8,67.9 44.9,68.1 50.0,59.1 55.1,58.2 60.3,57.4 65.4,63.5 70.5,73.5 75.6,76.2 80.7,73.3 85.8,70.7 91.0,73.8 96.1,74.4 101.2,74.6 106.3,79.3 111.4,81.0 116.5,79.1 121.6,66.3 126.8,72.8 131.9,62.5 137.0,60.7 142.1,58.3 147.2,62.1 152.3,73.9 157.4,76.6 162.6,73.6 167.7,79.0 172.8,72.4 177.9,77.1 183.0,83.2 188.1,85.5 193.2,97.2 198.4,86.0 203.5,86.5 208.6,78.5 213.7,79.2 218.8,89.6 223.9,95.1 229.0,94.9 234.2,90.5 239.3,83.2 244.4,77.2 249.5,75.9 254.6,74.0 259.7,53.2 264.9,54.7 270.0,51.8 275.1,54.2 280.2,51.0 285.3,32.5 290.4,24.6 295.5,26.2 300.7,21.4 305.8,12.8 310.9,14.7 316.0,14.9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1c1c1e\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/><circle cx=\"316.0\" cy=\"14.9\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#1c1c1e\"/></svg></div><div class=\"spark spv\" data-sp=\"3\" style=\"display:\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" style=\"width:100%; height:auto; background:#fffdf6; border-radius:8px;\"><polyline points=\"4.0,46.7 6.1,59.4 8.3,58.4 10.4,72.5 12.5,69.9 14.7,68.8 16.8,75.9 19.0,78.2 21.1,79.8 23.2,80.4 25.4,82.7 27.5,90.5 29.6,91.2 31.8,84.6 33.9,80.4 36.1,81.7 38.2,80.9 40.3,77.2 42.5,91.1 44.6,97.2 46.7,92.4 48.9,97.0 51.0,96.3 53.2,91.0 55.3,92.1 57.4,90.7 59.6,88.1 61.7,89.2 63.8,85.9 66.0,83.8 68.1,72.9 70.2,74.2 72.4,78.2 